      "comment": "Message displayed when the app is able to automatically detect the user's area.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Tap one button and Apple Intelligence writes recipes for your exact pantry — on-device, private, no internet needed. Never stare at a wilting vegetable again.": {
      "comment": "Description of the second onboarding step, describing how the app saves food using Apple's on-device AI.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Tippen genügt — Apple Intelligence schreibt Rezepte aus deinem genauen Vorrat. On-device, privat, ohne Internet. Du musst nie wieder welkes Gemüse anstarren."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toca un botón y Apple Intelligence te escribe recetas con tu despensa exacta — en el dispositivo, privado, sin internet. No vuelvas a mirar una verdura marchita."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appuyez sur un bouton et Apple Intelligence écrit des recettes pour votre garde-manger exact — sur l'appareil, privé, sans internet. Plus jamais vous ne fixerez un légume fané."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ボタン1つで、Apple Intelligenceがあなたのパントリーから料理レシピを生成 — デバイス内処理、プライベート、インターネット不要。しおれた野菜を見つめる時間とお別れ。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toque um botão e a Apple Intelligence cria receitas exatas para a sua despensa — no dispositivo, privado, sem internet. Nunca mais encare um legume murcho."
          }
        }
      }
    },
