    "We couldn't complete sign in. Please try again, or use email sign in.": {
      "comment": "Error message displayed when Apple sign in fails.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "We couldn't find a neighbourhood for that location. Try entering a place name instead.": {
      "comment": "Error message when a location geocode request fails.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "We couldn't find that barcode in the product database. You can still add the item manually.": {
      "comment": "Error message when a barcode lookup fails.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "We couldn't post this — please refresh and try again.": {
      "comment": "Error message when the listing couldn't be created.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "We couldn't process that image. Try a different photo.": {
      "comment": "Error message when an image upload fails due to processing issues.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "We couldn't read that image. Try a different photo.": {
      "comment": "Error message shown when the user tries to upload an image that's not supported.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "We'll gently remind you before food goes bad — so nothing gets wasted and your wallet stays happy.": {
      "comment": "A description of the benefits of enabling notifications.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir erinnern dich sanft, bevor Lebensmittel schlecht werden — nichts wird verschwendet, dein Geldbeutel freut sich."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te recordaremos suavemente antes de que la comida se estropee — para que nada se desperdicie y tu cartera siga contenta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous vous rappellerons doucement avant que la nourriture ne se gâte — rien ne se perd et votre porte-monnaie est content."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "食品が傷む前にやさしくお知らせします — 無駄をなくし、お財布もハッピーに。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avisaremos com carinho antes que os alimentos estraguem — nada se desperdiça e sua carteira agradece."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We're currently reaching out to supermarkets to bring you benefits and perks when using Freshli. When you shop, your purchases will automatically show up in the app — no scanning, no manual entry.": {
      "comment": "A description of the benefits of using the app when shopping at supermarkets.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
